.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-preset-eject 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-preset\-eject \- Copy a preset module and its call closure into policy/<preset>/ and load the copies instead
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten preset eject\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fItarget\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Copy a preset module and its call closure into policy/<preset>/ and load the copies instead
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fItarget\fR>
The module to eject, as <preset>/<module>, e.g. claude\-code\-cloud/plan\-mode\-refuses\-writes
